  triage:title "assign_to_active_member_persists_with_zero_prompts_until_idle does not drive any ticks or an Active->Idle transition" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (req-qa), PR #1408 @ 5ab184d75, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5642703785. Named test exists but does not drive any ticks or an Active->Idle transition, so it does not verify the zero-prompts-until-idle behavior it is named for. This id (ATM-QA-006) is reused by req-qa across QA passes and collides in string form with BA.1's own, unrelated, already-closed informational finding of the same name -- these are two distinct findings (flagged in the fork report, not resolved here). fenix's ruling: fix in R1 if practical, or explicit deferral by ruling." ;
